{"product_id":"the-3-mistakes-of-my-life","title":"The 3 Mistakes Of My Life","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn late-2000, a young boy in Ahmedabad called Govind dreamt of having a business. To accomodate his friends Ish and Omi's passion, they open a cricket shop. Govind's wants to make money and thinks big. Ish is all about nurturing Ali, the batsman with a rare gift. Omi knows his limited capabiltiies and just wants to be with his friends. However, nothing comes easy in a turbulent city. To realize their goals, they will have to face it all - religious politics, earthquakes, riots, unacceptable love and above all, their own mistakes. Will they make it? Can an individual's dreams overcome the nightmares offered by real life? Can we succeed despite a few mistakes? Based on real events, from the bestselling author of \"Five Point Someone\" and \"One Night @ the call centre\", comes another dark, witty tale about modern India.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Chetan Bhagat\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9788129113726\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages: 257\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 130 x 210\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41757944643737,"sku":"11RE9788129113726","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-3-mistakes-of-my-life-244029.jpg?v=1694791684","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-3-mistakes-of-my-life","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}